1
00:00:00,021 --> 00:00:01,941
(Sheldon:)If it were a game,
here are your choices.

2
00:00:02,148 --> 00:00:03,938
(Sheldon:)An e-mail from an old acquaintance...

3
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:07,740
(Sheldon:)...or the head of one of the largest
religious institutions in the world...

4
00:00:07,945 --> 00:00:11,535
...slam-dunking
to "Sweet Georgia Brown." Pick.

5
00:00:14,035 --> 00:00:16,745
(Leonard:)Just do it,
because he's not gonna let it go.

6
00:00:16,954 --> 00:00:19,954
- Basketball Pope.
- And that's how it's done.

7
00:00:22,376 --> 00:00:23,416
What are you gonna do?

8
00:00:23,628 --> 00:00:25,458
(Penny:)- Are you gonna see him?
- I don't know.

9
00:00:25,671 --> 00:00:28,841
(Sheldon:)Is this the fellow who peed
in your Hawaiian Punch?

10
00:00:29,592 --> 00:00:31,302
(Leonard:)No, that was a different guy.

11
00:00:31,803 --> 00:00:34,973
(Sheldon:)Was he the one who wedgied you
so hard your testicle reascended...

12
00:00:35,181 --> 00:00:39,061
(Sheldon:)...and you spent your whole Christmas
break waiting for it to come back down?

13
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,560
(Leonard:)No, that was a different different guy.

14
00:00:45,358 --> 00:00:48,568
(Sheldon:)Was he the one who used your head
to open a nut?

15
00:00:50,196 --> 00:00:52,236
(Leonard:)- No.
- Oh, oh, oh.

16
00:00:52,448 --> 00:00:55,328
(Sheldon:)Was he the one
who made you eat your arm hair?

17
00:00:56,744 --> 00:00:59,624
(Leonard:)No, but actually,
that was this guy's sister.

18
00:01:00,164 --> 00:01:02,874
(Penny:)- Well, what do you think he wants?
- I don't know.

19
00:01:03,084 --> 00:01:04,914
(Sheldon:)The holidays
are just around the corner.

20
00:01:05,128 --> 00:01:08,968
(Sheldon:)Maybe he wants to see if he can lodge
the other testicle up there.

21
